@startuml Fluxo: Registrar Cliente
!define AUML https://plantuml.com/picto/
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

actor Rec as "👤 Recepcionista"
participant API as "API"
participant Service as "ClientService"
participant Repo as "ClientRepository"
participant DB as "🗄️ PostgreSQL"
participant Cache as "💾 Redis"
participant Email as "📧 Email Service"

== 1️⃣ Recepcionista Envia Dados ==

Rec ->> API: POST /clients\n{name, email, cpf, phone, password}
activate API

== 2️⃣ API Recebe e Valida ==

API ->> API: Autenticação JWT ✓\nAutorização ✓\nValidação Joi ✓
note right of API: Verifica se request é válido\ne se usuário é recepcionista

API ->> Service: createClient(data)
activate Service

== 3️⃣ ClientService Executa Lógica ==

Service ->> Service: validateData()\n✓ CPF format\n✓ Email format\n✓ Telefone format\n✓ Password strength
note right of Service: Validações de negócio

Service ->> Cache: get(client:email:{email})
activate Cache
Cache -->> Service: null (not exists)
deactivate Cache

Service ->> Repo: findByEmail(email)
activate Repo

== 4️⃣ ClientRepository Consulta BD ==

Repo ->> DB: SELECT * FROM clients\nWHERE email = $1
activate DB
DB -->> Repo: null (cliente não existe)
deactivate DB

Repo -->> Service: null
deactivate Repo

note right of Service: Email único ✓

Service ->> Service: hashPassword(password)\nbcrypt 12 rounds\n~250ms

== 5️⃣ ClientRepository Persiste ==

Service ->> Repo: save(clientData)
activate Repo

Repo ->> DB: INSERT INTO clients\n(name, email, cpf, phone,\npassword_hash, created_at)\nVALUES (...)
activate DB
DB -->> Repo: ✓ client_id: 123\nRETURNING *
deactivate DB

== 6️⃣ Cache Atualizado ==

Repo ->> Cache: set(client:email:{email}, {...})
activate Cache
Cache -->> Repo: OK
deactivate Cache

Repo -->> Service: Client{id: 123, ...}
deactivate Repo

== 7️⃣ Email de Confirmação ==

Service ->> Email: send(email, 'client-registered')
activate Email
note right of Email: Async - não bloqueia request\nEmail fica em fila (Bull)
Email -->> Service: ✓ queued
deactivate Email

== 8️⃣ Resposta Final ==

Service -->> API: Client{id: 123, name, email, ...}
deactivate Service

API ->> API: formatResponse(client)

API -->> Rec: 201 Created\n{client data + createdAt}
deactivate API

Rec -->> Rec: ✓ Cliente registrado com sucesso!

note over Email: 📧 Email é enviado background\naté 30s depois da resposta

== Fluxo de Erro (Email inválido) ==

Note over Service: ❌ Se findByEmail retorna\ncliente existente:

Service -->> API: Error 409 Conflict\n"Email já cadastrado"
API -->> Rec: 409 Conflict\n"Cliente já existe"

@enduml
